; A broken download, made deterministic with --break-download-at: package
; roots of its own, SYS:NbCli for apkg and SYS:NbGui for the window.
Failat 21
Protect RAM:rxt/apkg +e
Protect RAM:rxt/PkgManager +e
Delete SYS:NbCli ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete SYS:NbGui ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:NbGui
MakeDir SYS:NbGui/db
MakeDir SYS:NbGui/cache
